      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Spinal anaesthesia, is nowadays one of the safest anaesthetic techniques with low complication rates. Postspinal headache is a complication of spinal anaesthesia. This paper presents several factors associated with the development of postspinal headache and discusses the reduction, prediction and treatment of postspinal headache."},
